<!-- HERO -->
<div class="hero-wrap">
    <div class="hero-slide active"></div>
    <div class="hero-slide"></div>
    <div class="hero-slide"></div>
    <div class="hero-dots">
        <button class="hero-dot active" aria-label="Slide 1"></button>
        <button class="hero-dot" aria-label="Slide 2"></button>
        <button class="hero-dot" aria-label="Slide 3"></button>
    </div>
    <div class="hero">
        <div>
            <div class="hero-tag"><svg class="icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" style="width:1.1em;height:1.1em;"><path d="M12 3v4M12 17v4M5 5l2.5 2.5M16.5 16.5L19 19M3 12h4M17 12h4M5 19l2.5-2.5M16.5 7.5L19 5"/><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="2"/></svg> Pusat Tumbuh Kembang Anak & Psikologi</div>
            <h1>
                Setiap anak berhak<br>
                tumbuh dengan<br>
                <span class="hl">penuh potensi.</span>
            </h1>
            <p>
                Madania Center hadir untuk mendampingi anak-anak dengan ADHD, keterlambatan bicara, autisme,
                dan kebutuhan khusus lainnya, dengan pendekatan hangat, ilmiah, dan berpusat pada keluarga.
            </p>
            <div class="hero-btns">
                <a href="#contact" class="btn-gold">Konsultasi Gratis</a>
                <a href="#programs" class="btn-white-outline">Lihat Layanan Kami</a>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="wave">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 1440 56" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" preserveAspectRatio="none" width="100%" height="56">
            <path d="M0,28 C480,56 960,0 1440,28 L1440,56 L0,56 Z" fill="#FFFAF4"/>
        </svg>
    </div>
</div>

<!-- SIGNS CHECK -->
<section class="signs-section">
    <p class="section-label">Kenali Sejak Dini</p>
    <h2 class="section-title">Apakah anak Anda menunjukkan tanda-tanda ini?</h2>
    <p class="section-sub">Mengenali tanda-tanda sejak awal adalah langkah pertama untuk memberikan dukungan yang tepat bagi anak Anda.</p>
    <div class="signs-grid">
        <div class="sign-card">
            <div class="sign-dot"><svg class="icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" style="width:1.6em;height:1.6em;"><path d="M21 11.5a8.38 8.38 0 0 1-.9 3.8 8.5 8.5 0 0 1-7.6 4.7 8.38 8.38 0 0 1-3.8-.9L3 21l1.9-5.7a8.38 8.38 0 0 1-.9-3.8 8.5 8.5 0 0 1 4.7-7.6 8.38 8.38 0 0 1 3.8-.9h.5a8.48 8.48 0 0 1 8 8v.5z"/></svg></div>
            <h4>Keterlambatan Bicara</h4>
            <p>Kosakata terbatas, sulit mengekspresikan diri, atau bicara tidak jelas untuk usianya.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="sign-card">
            <div class="sign-dot"><svg class="icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" style="width:1.6em;height:1.6em;"><path d="M13 2 3 14h7l-1 8 10-12h-7l1-8z"/></svg></div>
            <h4>ADHD / Sulit Fokus</h4>
            <p>Sulit duduk diam, impulsif, atau susah mengikuti instruksi di rumah dan sekolah.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="sign-card">
            <div class="sign-dot"><svg class="icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" style="width:1.6em;height:1.6em;"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><path d="M8 14s1.5 2 4 2 4-2 4-2"/><line x1="9" y1="9" x2="9.01" y2="9"/><line x1="15" y1="9" x2="15.01" y2="9"/></svg></div>
            <h4>Interaksi Sosial</h4>
            <p>Menghindari kontak mata, kesulitan berteman, atau membaca isyarat sosial.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="sign-card">
            <div class="sign-dot"><svg class="icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" style="width:1.6em;height:1.6em;"><path d="M2 3h6a4 4 0 0 1 4 4v14a3 3 0 0 0-3-3H2z"/><path d="M22 3h-6a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v14a3 3 0 0 1 3-3h7z"/></svg></div>
            <h4>Kesulitan Belajar</h4>
            <p>Mengalami hambatan dalam membaca, menulis, atau koordinasi motorik di sekolah.</p>
        </div>
    </div>
    <p style="text-align:center; margin-top: 36px; color: var(--muted); font-size: 0.95rem;">
        <strong style="color:var(--blue); font-family:'Quicksand',sans-serif;">Anda tidak sendiri.</strong> Intervensi dini membuat perbedaan besar.
    </p>
</section>
<section class="programs" id="programs">
    <p class="section-label">Layanan Kami</p>
    <h2 class="section-title">Program Penanganan Spesialis</h2>
    <p class="section-sub">Setiap program dirancang khusus sesuai kebutuhan unik anak Anda, ditangani oleh terapis bersertifikat.</p>
    <div class="programs-grid">
        <div class="prog-card b">
            <div class="prog-icon" style="background:var(--blue-light);"><svg class="icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" style="width:1.6em;height:1.6em;"><path d="M13 2 3 14h7l-1 8 10-12h-7l1-8z"/></svg></div>
            <div class="prog-card-content">
                <h3>Terapi ADHD</h3>
                <p>Intervensi perilaku, strategi fokus, dan coaching orang tua untuk membantu anak dengan ADHD berkembang di rumah dan sekolah.</p>
                <div class="prog-footer">
                    <span class="prog-tag" style="background:var(--blue-light);color:var(--blue);">Usia 4–16 tahun</span>
                    <div class="prog-arrow">→</div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="prog-card g">
            <div class="prog-icon" style="background:var(--green-light);"><svg class="icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" style="width:1.6em;height:1.6em;"><path d="M21 11.5a8.38 8.38 0 0 1-.9 3.8 8.5 8.5 0 0 1-7.6 4.7 8.38 8.38 0 0 1-3.8-.9L3 21l1.9-5.7a8.38 8.38 0 0 1-.9-3.8 8.5 8.5 0 0 1 4.7-7.6 8.38 8.38 0 0 1 3.8-.9h.5a8.48 8.48 0 0 1 8 8v.5z"/></svg></div>
            <div class="prog-card-content">
                <h3>Terapi Wicara</h3>
                <p>Sesi individual untuk membangun kemampuan komunikasi, dari kata pertama hingga hambatan bahasa yang kompleks.</p>
                <div class="prog-footer">
                    <span class="prog-tag" style="background:var(--green-light);color:var(--green);">Usia 1–7 tahun</span>
                    <div class="prog-arrow">→</div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="prog-card p">
            <div class="prog-icon" style="background:#F2EAFF;"><svg class="icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" style="width:1.6em;height:1.6em;"><path d="M19.439 7.85c-.049.322.059.648.289.878l1.568 1.568c.47.47.706 1.087.706 1.704s-.235 1.233-.706 1.704l-1.611 1.611a.98.98 0 0 1-.837.276c-.275-.057-.532-.183-.723-.379a2.501 2.501 0 1 0-3.346 3.97c.187.196.241.453.184.728-.057.275-.183.532-.379.723l-1.611 1.611c-.47.47-1.087.706-1.704.706s-1.233-.235-1.704-.706l-1.568-1.568a1.026 1.026 0 0 0-.877-.289c-.196.196-.453.241-.728.184a2.5 2.5 0 1 1-3.95-1.97 2.5 2.5 0 0 1 3.97-3.346.987.987 0 0 0 .728-.184c.196-.196.241-.453.184-.728a2.5 2.5 0 1 1 3.97-3.346c.196.196.453.241.728.184.275-.057.532-.183.723-.379l1.611-1.611c.47-.47 1.087-.706 1.704-.706s1.233.235 1.704.706l1.568 1.568c.196.196.453.241.728.184"/></svg></div>
            <div class="prog-card-content">
                <h3>Terapi Autisme (ASD)</h3>
                <p>Terapi ABA berbasis bukti dan pelatihan keterampilan sosial untuk mendukung anak dengan spektrum autisme.</p>
                <div class="prog-footer">
                    <span class="prog-tag" style="background:#F2EAFF;color:#9C59D1;">Usia 2–16 tahun</span>
                    <div class="prog-arrow">→</div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="prog-card go">
            <div class="prog-icon" style="background:var(--gold-light);"><svg class="icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" style="width:1.6em;height:1.6em;"><path d="M18 11V6a2 2 0 0 0-4 0v5"/><path d="M14 10V4a2 2 0 0 0-4 0v6"/><path d="M10 10.5V6a2 2 0 0 0-4 0v8"/><path d="M18 8a2 2 0 1 1 4 0v6a8 8 0 0 1-8 8h-2c-2.8 0-4.5-.86-5.99-2.34l-3.6-3.6a2 2 0 0 1 2.83-2.82L7 15"/></svg></div>
            <div class="prog-card-content">
                <h3>Terapi Okupasi</h3>
                <p>Mengembangkan kemampuan motorik halus, pengolahan sensorik, dan kemandirian aktivitas sehari-hari.</p>
                <div class="prog-footer">
                    <span class="prog-tag" style="background:var(--gold-light);color:#A07000;">Usia 2–14 tahun</span>
                    <div class="prog-arrow">→</div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="prog-card t">
            <div class="prog-icon" style="background:#E5F6FA;"><svg class="icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" style="width:1.6em;height:1.6em;"><path d="M9.5 2A2.5 2.5 0 0 0 7 4.5v.5A2.5 2.5 0 0 0 5 7.5 2.5 2.5 0 0 0 6 12a2.5 2.5 0 0 0 1 4.5A2.5 2.5 0 0 0 9.5 19a2.5 2.5 0 0 0 2.5-2.5V4.5A2.5 2.5 0 0 0 9.5 2z"/><path d="M14.5 2A2.5 2.5 0 0 1 17 4.5v.5a2.5 2.5 0 0 1 2 2.5 2.5 2.5 0 0 1-1 4.5 2.5 2.5 0 0 1-1 4.5 2.5 2.5 0 0 1-2.5 2.5 2.5 2.5 0 0 1-2.5-2.5V4.5A2.5 2.5 0 0 1 14.5 2z"/></svg></div>
            <div class="prog-card-content">
                <h3>Konsultasi Psikologi</h3>
                <p>Asesmen menyeluruh dan konsultasi psikologis untuk memahami tumbuh kembang dan kondisi anak secara holistik.</p>
                <div class="prog-footer">
                    <span class="prog-tag" style="background:#E5F6FA;color:#1A9BB5;">Semua Usia</span>
                    <div class="prog-arrow">→</div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="prog-card r">
            <div class="prog-icon" style="background:#FDEAEA;"><svg class="icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" style="width:1.6em;height:1.6em;"><path d="M17 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H5a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2"/><circle cx="9" cy="7" r="4"/><path d="M23 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-3-3.87"/><path d="M16 3.13a4 4 0 0 1 0 7.75"/></svg></div>
            <div class="prog-card-content">
                <h3>Hypnotherapy & Parenting</h3>
                <p>Sesi hypnotherapy klinis dan pelatihan parenting untuk memperkuat hubungan keluarga dan mendukung perkembangan anak.</p>
                <div class="prog-footer">
                    <span class="prog-tag" style="background:#FDEAEA;color:#D15959;">Orang Tua & Anak</span>
                    <div class="prog-arrow">→</div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<!-- HOW IT WORKS -->
<section class="how" id="how">
    <p class="section-label">Proses Kami</p>
    <h2 class="section-title">Bagaimana kami membantu</h2>
    <p class="section-sub">Dari konsultasi pertama hingga perkembangan berkelanjutan, kami mendampingi setiap langkah.</p>
    <div class="steps">
        <div class="step">
            <div class="step-num"><svg class="icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" style="width:1.6em;height:1.6em;"><path d="M22 16.92v3a2 2 0 0 1-2.18 2 19.79 19.79 0 0 1-8.63-3.07 19.5 19.5 0 0 1-6-6 19.79 19.79 0 0 1-3.07-8.67A2 2 0 0 1 4.11 2h3a2 2 0 0 1 2 1.72c.127.96.361 1.903.7 2.81a2 2 0 0 1-.45 2.11L8.09 9.91a16 16 0 0 0 6 6l1.27-1.27a2 2 0 0 1 2.11-.45c.907.339 1.85.573 2.81.7A2 2 0 0 1 22 16.92z"/></svg></div>
            <h4>Konsultasi Gratis</h4>
            <p>30 menit untuk memahami kebutuhan anak Anda dan menjawab semua pertanyaan, tanpa komitmen.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="step">
            <div class="step-num"><svg class="icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" style="width:1.6em;height:1.6em;"><circle cx="11" cy="11" r="8"/><line x1="21" y1="21" x2="16.65" y2="16.65"/></svg></div>
            <h4>Asesmen Menyeluruh</h4>
            <p>Evaluasi komprehensif oleh spesialis kami untuk mengidentifikasi kekuatan dan area dukungan anak.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="step">
            <div class="step-num"><svg class="icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" style="width:1.6em;height:1.6em;"><path d="M16 4h2a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v14a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H6a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V6a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h2"/><rect x="8" y="2" width="8" height="4" rx="1" ry="1"/></svg></div>
            <h4>Rencana Personal</h4>
            <p>Program terapi yang disesuaikan dengan tujuan yang jelas, ditinjau bersama keluarga.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="step">
            <div class="step-num"><svg class="icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" style="width:1.6em;height:1.6em;"><polyline points="23 6 13.5 15.5 8.5 10.5 1 18"/><polyline points="17 6 23 6 23 12"/></svg></div>
            <h4>Pantau Perkembangan</h4>
            <p>Sesi rutin, laporan kemajuan, dan check-in keluarga untuk merayakan setiap pencapaian.</p>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<!-- TEAM -->
<section class="team" id="team">
    <p class="section-label">Tim Profesional</p>
    <h2 class="section-title">Kenali Spesialis Kami</h2>
    <p class="section-sub">Tim multidisiplin kami membawa keahlian, kesabaran, dan kepedulian tulus untuk setiap anak.</p>
    <div class="team-grid">
        <div class="team-card" style="--accent:var(--blue);">
            <div class="team-photo-wrap"><div class="team-photo-circle"><img src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns%3D%22http%3A//www.w3.org/2000/svg%22%20width%3D%22400%22%20height%3D%22300%22%20viewBox%3D%220%200%20400%20300%22%3E%3Cdefs%3E%3ClinearGradient%20id%3D%22ga%22%20x1%3D%220%22%20y1%3D%220%22%20x2%3D%221%22%20y2%3D%221%22%3E%3Cstop%20offset%3D%220%22%20stop-color%3D%22%231A3AB5%22/%3E%3Cstop%20offset%3D%221%22%20stop-color%3D%22%233357E8%22/%3E%3C/linearGradient%3E%3C/defs%3E%3Crect%20width%3D%22400%22%20height%3D%22300%22%20fill%3D%22url%28%23ga%29%22/%3E%3Ccircle%20cx%3D%22200%22%20cy%3D%22115%22%20r%3D%2255%22%20fill%3D%22%23ffffff%22%20opacity%3D%220.85%22/%3E%3Cpath%20d%3D%22M90%20290%20c0-70%2050-110%20110-110%20s110%2040%20110%20110%20z%22%20fill%3D%22%23ffffff%22%20opacity%3D%220.85%22/%3E%3C/svg%3E" alt="Dr. Sari Dewi, M.Psi"/></div><span class="team-badge">Asesmen</span></div>
            <div class="team-body">
                <h3>Agus Binti Khoiriyah S.Psi,M.Si,Psikolog</h3>
                <p class="role">Psikolog Klinis Anak</p>
                <p>12 tahun pengalaman dalam tumbuh kembang anak, ADHD, dan gangguan spektrum autisme.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="team-card" style="--accent:var(--green);">
            <div class="team-photo-wrap"><div class="team-photo-circle"><img src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns%3D%22http%3A//www.w3.org/2000/svg%22%20width%3D%22400%22%20height%3D%22300%22%20viewBox%3D%220%200%20400%20300%22%3E%3Cdefs%3E%3ClinearGradient%20id%3D%22gb%22%20x1%3D%220%22%20y1%3D%220%22%20x2%3D%221%22%20y2%3D%221%22%3E%3Cstop%20offset%3D%220%22%20stop-color%3D%22%23145E20%22/%3E%3Cstop%20offset%3D%221%22%20stop-color%3D%22%232BA341%22/%3E%3C/linearGradient%3E%3C/defs%3E%3Crect%20width%3D%22400%22%20height%3D%22300%22%20fill%3D%22url%28%23gb%29%22/%3E%3Ccircle%20cx%3D%22200%22%20cy%3D%22115%22%20r%3D%2255%22%20fill%3D%22%23ffffff%22%20opacity%3D%220.85%22/%3E%3Cpath%20d%3D%22M90%20290%20c0-70%2050-110%20110-110%20s110%2040%20110%20110%20z%22%20fill%3D%22%23ffffff%22%20opacity%3D%220.85%22/%3E%3C/svg%3E" alt="Budi Santoso, S.ST"/></div><span class="team-badge">Speech Therapy</span></div>
            <div class="team-body">
                <h3>Wahyu Budi Santoso, S.Psi,S.ST</h3>
                <p class="role">Terapis Wicara</p>
                <p>Spesialis keterlambatan bicara, gangguan bahasa, dan komunikasi pada anak usia dini.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="team-card" style="--accent:var(--gold);">
            <div class="team-photo-wrap"><div class="team-photo-circle"><img src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns%3D%22http%3A//www.w3.org/2000/svg%22%20width%3D%22400%22%20height%3D%22300%22%20viewBox%3D%220%200%20400%20300%22%3E%3Cdefs%3E%3ClinearGradient%20id%3D%22gc%22%20x1%3D%220%22%20y1%3D%220%22%20x2%3D%221%22%20y2%3D%221%22%3E%3Cstop%20offset%3D%220%22%20stop-color%3D%22%23C98200%22/%3E%3Cstop%20offset%3D%221%22%20stop-color%3D%22%23F0A500%22/%3E%3C/linearGradient%3E%3C/defs%3E%3Crect%20width%3D%22400%22%20height%3D%22300%22%20fill%3D%22url%28%23gc%29%22/%3E%3Ccircle%20cx%3D%22200%22%20cy%3D%22115%22%20r%3D%2255%22%20fill%3D%22%23ffffff%22%20opacity%3D%220.85%22/%3E%3Cpath%20d%3D%22M90%20290%20c0-70%2050-110%20110-110%20s110%2040%20110%20110%20z%22%20fill%3D%22%23ffffff%22%20opacity%3D%220.85%22/%3E%3C/svg%3E" alt="Rina Kusuma, OT"/></div><span class="team-badge">Okupasi</span></div>
            <div class="team-body">
                <h3>Karina Kusuma Putri, S.Psi,OT</h3>
                <p class="role">Terapis Okupasi</p>
                <p>Ahli integrasi sensorik, motorik halus, dan membantu anak mandiri di lingkungan sekolah.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="team-card" style="--accent:#9C59D1;">
